### 5. CORRECTIVE ACTION B — CANONICAL DOMAIN MODEL

**Priority: P0 — Release blocking**

Inspect the existing model first. Extend or normalize existing entities rather than blindly creating duplicate tables.

The implementation must support the following conceptual record groups. Exact physical names may follow established repository conventions.

#### 5.1 Resource identity and accountability

Support:

