### 21. DEFINITION OF DONE

The corrective action is complete only when all applicable conditions below are demonstrated.

1. No server-process memory or browser state is the authoritative persistence mechanism for business records.
2. Business mutations are confirmed by durable server-side writes.
3. Failed API/database operations cannot masquerade as successful business changes.
