5. The issue lifecycle is enforced server-side.
6. Original intake and consequential changes remain traceable.
7. Evidence provenance, uncertainty, contradictions, and freshness are represented honestly.
8. Unknown values are not silently treated as zero, healthy, or feasible.
9. Mandatory feasibility constraints are evaluated before candidate ranking.
